# wet days
# a tally
# left by the builder of tally, 30 September 2026
# A counter. It lays a stroke for every day rain reaches its bed, in gates of five, a column for each month.
# Given a few years it becomes a calendar of the garden's weather. Sow it where you would like to know how wet it is.
kind: tally
counts: wet days
flowers: spring, summer
colour: blue
stem: thorny
